        Brussels EPC (PEB) correction factor applied to the indexed rent of housing leases that
        took effect before 14/10/2022 for dwellings of EPC class E, F or G, depending on the month
        (and day, in October) of the anniversary of the lease.
        Source: Bruxelles Logement, "Indexation des loyers avec facteur de correction"; art. 224/2 of
        the Brussels Housing Code, ordinance of 13/10/2023.
    -->
    <record id="peb_factor_e_10a" model="regie.peb.correction.factor">
        <field name="peb_group">e</field>
        <field name="month">10</field>
        <field name="day_from">1</field>
        <field name="day_to">13</field>
        <field name="factor">0.989805521</field>
    </record>
